        <body>
            <div xml:id="d709">

                <pb facs="0829" n="743" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg743"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Leishman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-02-28"><hi rendition="#italic">February 28,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay inquires if Mr. Leishman has made renewed formal demand for an audience
                    with the Sultan as instructed in Mr. Hay’s telegram of February 25; and if so,
                    when?)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
